<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer ups Gateway.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer ups Gateway.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer analyst Jim Poyner raised personal computer maker Gateway 2000 Inc to outperform from market perform, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>--E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
